  "description": [
    "A tertiary amine that is <em>N</em>-methyl-1-naphthalenemethylamine in which the amino hydrogen is replaced by a 3-(<em>tert</em>butylethynyl)allyl group. An antifungal agent administered orally (generally as the hydrochloride salt) for the treatment of skin and nail infections."
  ],
